  "callback_boundaries": {
    "context_runtime": "context.Context cancellation/Done/Err. Preserve cooperative cancellation semantics; runtime scheduling is outside the semantic port. Native implementations are standard-library context, with incremental and IPC callers overincluded by CHA.",
    "reflection_runtime": "reflect.Type inspection in native option/package-JSON decoding. Existing S07 typed declarations and option/package-JSON probes are the Rust boundary; Go reflect itself is not a new checker algorithm.",
    "iterator_continuation": "Go range-over-function yield or maps.Keys/Values/sync.Map.Range continuation. Port the caller's loop/body and collection order, not a user-supplied unknown algorithm. Concrete callbacks and surrounding generic bodies remain in the conservative function inventory; SSA may retain unspecialized templates. Check caller traversal at its algorithm checkpoint.",
    "checker_pool_factory": "Program.initCheckerPool checks ProgramOptions.CreateCheckerPool; native baseline constructs ProgramOptions without this override and takes newCheckerPoolWithTracing. Custom pool injection is not a frozen request. Checker operation ownership remains a P2 implementation obligation.",
    "encoder_generic_template": "Uninstantiated GetOrComputeSourceFileData[T] closure included by signature expansion. Concrete uses at the pin are internal/api/encoder/encoder.go:409,419, outside these roots; preserve existing S06 encoder lazy-data behavior, not a new S08 callback.",
    "extended_config_cache": "Optional tsoptions.ExtendedConfigCache.GetExtendedConfig callback; native compiler fixture builds options directly, and config resolver inputs are S07 pre-checker work. Do not return empty cache entries in a future real implementation; existing config-resolver fixture authority applies.",
    "source_map_host": "sourcemap.ECMAHost.GetECMALineInfo is a source-map consumption callback. Current primary schedule collects declaration diagnostics but no source-map output or mapped external files. Guarded boundary, not a fabricated nil host implementation.",
    "mapper_process_runtime": "contentmapper.SpawnerFunc/IPC net.Listener/net.Addr/Close are process and transport boundaries. Frozen ordinary acceptance inputs exclude external mapper execution. Informational execution remains separately recorded; no successful no-op host adapter is authorized.",
    "locale_matcher": "golang.org/x/text/language.Matcher.Match selects localized diagnostic tables. Capture uses the native default locale; preserve selected message keys and argument text. External language matcher bodies are runtime boundaries."
  },
